<title>JAPAN: S.African investment cap seen above 160,000 rand.</title>
<headline>S.African investment cap seen above 160,000 rand.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African Finance Minister Trevor Manuel said on Wednesday it was unlikely that South Africa's ceiling for individual investment abroad would be set below 160,000 rand.</p>
</text>
